<title>PAKISTAN: CRICKET-PCB XI 32-2 V NEW ZEALAND (171) - CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PCB XI 32-2 V NEW ZEALAND (171) - CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>SAHIWAL, Pakistan 1996-11-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Pakistan Cricket Board (PCB) XI were 32-2 in reply to New Zealand's first innings of 171 at the close on the opening day of their three-day match on Sunday.</p>
</text>
